    "linkedinUrl": "https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/20141002235221-55517318-grant-writing-success",
    "bodyText": "<p>A lot of people ask me what it takes to be successful in getting grant proposals funded. The key to being successful in grant applications is to develop a solid relationship with the funding agencies. They will tell you exactly what they want to fund. Your job is to develop a project that is responsive to their needs. </p>"
